OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F394A1786630729
OL,3,CHow and when to watch the solar
OL,4,Ceclipse in the North East and North
OL,5,CYorkshire
OL,7,FThe partial solar eclipse will see the
OL,8,Fmoon moving in front of the sun and
OL,9,Fcovering between 89 and 91% at its
OL,10,Fpeak in the region.
OL,12,FWhile the peak will be witnessed at
OL,13,Fdifferent times depending where you
OL,14,Fare in the region, they will differ
OL,15,Fonly by a minute or two.
OL,17,FPartial eclipse timings for Gateshead
OL,19,F6:10pm - Partial eclipse begins
OL,21,F6:33pm - Temperature changes
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G2/7
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
