PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F394A1786630729
OL,3,CHow and when to watch the solar
OL,4,Ceclipse in the North East and North
OL,5,CYorkshire
OL,7,FSource: timeanddate.com info
OL,9,FThe eclipse begins and peaks earlier
OL,10,Fthe further north you are while those
OL,11,Ffurther west will experience more
OL,12,Fcoverage at its maximum.
OL,14,FIn Berwick, the peak will happen at
OL,15,F7:07pm while York will see its peak at
OL,16,F7:09pm.
OL,18,FThose in Scarborough will witness just
OL,19,F89.89% coverage while people in
OL,20,FHaltwhistle will witness 90.75%
OL,21,Fcoverage.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G4/7
