OL,3,CHow and when to watch the solar
OL,4,Ceclipse in the North East and North
OL,5,CYorkshire
OL,7,FThis map shows the forecast cloud
OL,8,Fcoverage, time of peak, and peak
OL,9,Fcoverage across the UK
OL,11,FHow do I watch it?
OL,13,FThe partial eclipse will be low in the
OL,14,Fhorizon - making it appear bigger.
OL,16,FThis means you have to have a view of
OL,17,Fthe western horizon, and ideally not
OL,18,Fbe surrounded by buildings or trees.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G5/7
