PN,39406
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F394A1786630729
OL,3,CHow and when to watch the solar
OL,4,Ceclipse in the North East and North
OL,5,CYorkshire
OL,7,FIf you are planning on looking up at
OL,8,Fthe sky for the eclipse, experts have
OL,9,Fwarned that only special solar eclipse
OL,10,Fglasses that are ISO 12312-2 certified
OL,11,Ffor the safest eye protection should
OL,12,Fbe used.
OL,14,FWatch parties are taking place across
OL,15,Fthe region including a sell-out event
OL,16,Fin Baltic Square in Gateshead thought
OL,17,Fto be the biggest in the country.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G6/7
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
