PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F394A1786630729
OL,3,CHow and when to watch the solar
OL,4,Ceclipse in the North East and North
OL,5,CYorkshire
OL,7,FITV News Tyne Tees will be live from
OL,8,Fthe banks of the River Tyne for the
OL,9,Fevent, from Northumberland and Whitby
OL,10,Ffrom 6pm.
OL,12,FYou can watch the programme live here
OL,13,Fon YouTube and stay with us to watch
OL,14,Fthe peak of the eclipse.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G7/7
